#Texans coach DeMeco Ryans on rookie defensive end Sabastian Harsh: 'Earned his way onto the team, found way to make plays. You see a guy wit the motor he has, strength he has, playmaking he has, the talent he has, we're not going to let a guy like that get away.' 
On undrafted rookie corner Collin Wright: 'Very consistent, never shied away, found a way to make a play on the football. They earned the right to be on the team. Both guys can help us win football games.'
